      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DIVOT (3) stalked the lead and fought on well to finish 3.5 lengths away in second (22.19) at Ballarat in a Grade 4/5 over 390m. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Rates highly and will give a great sight. HARD STYLE LEON (2) flew the lids from the middle with a slick turn of foot before finishing third (22.33) and beaten 2 lengths over 390m at this track. Bold showing expected. CHEEKY MILA (1) was below best last time but prior to that was narrowly beaten when eighth (22.28) in a Grade 4 at this track. Expecting sharp improvement this line-up. MEXICAN JACK (8) is a last start winner worth following up.",
